{"attachments":[{"content_type":null,"filename":"Solomon.jpg","id":"739866838736830464","local_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/attachments/738994547635519488/739866838736830464-Solomon.jpg","message_id":"739866838661595207","sha256":"099d662f050ebb80061c06c0302eb388f870cf17f7dcada2ae723282a669164d","size":23441,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/738994547635519488/739866838736830464/Solomon.jpg?ex=6abfcd30&is=6abe7bb0&hm=0456566878b33aba987c8b78ab6227c436e8412ca799efb652e6cb30f8b660a3&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"738994547635519488","content":"@everyone An illusory image pops into existence in the middle of the town square. A very handsome man dressed in robes addresses any who are nearby.\n\n\"How did everyone like my little Octopodidae welcoming party? I told it to give you...a hand getting to shore. Well, to be honest, I can't really take credit for that. From what I heard, you basically sank your little boat all by yourselves. Anyway, let me formally welcome you to this all-expenses-paid resort (food and safety not included, death and dismemberment may apply). I am sooooo looking forward to murdering you-- I mean meeting you all. Well, good luck out there my little blushing adventurers!\"\n\nThe image ends in a puff of sparkles.","created_at":"2020-08-03T15:26:40.398000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739866838661595207","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
